│  Center Specialist (Rudersdal). |                                            │
│  | Ophthalmologist | Refers patient to apply for screen reader | Interacts   │
│  with Visually Impaired Citizen, Municipal Caseworker (Hilleroed), and       │
│  Communication Center Specialist (Rudersdal). |                              │
